<title>USA: IHOP November same store sales up 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>IHOP November same store sales up 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said Monday its same store sales for the fiscal month of November were up 0.7 percent, compared to an increase of 1.2 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>IHOP develops, franchises and operates International House of Pancakes restaurants. As of September 30, 1996, the company had 711 restaurants of which 518 were operated by franchisees, 61 by the Company, and 132 by area licensees.</p>
